% $$
%
% where $G(z)$ is the digital controller and
% $H_{zoh}(z)$ is the plant transfer function in z-domain (obtained by
% implementing a zero-order hold).
%
% The mechanics of drawing the root-loci are exactly the same in the
% z-plane as in the s-plane. Recall from the continuous
% < ?example=Introduction&section=ControlRootLocus 
% Root-Locus Tutorial>, 
% we used the MATLAB function *sgrid* to find the root-locus region that 
% gives an acceptable gain ($K$). For the discrete root-locus analysis, we will
% use the function *zgrid*, which has the same function as sgrid. The 
